   <title>New fighting in Ethiopia&#039;s Tigray region raises fears of a return to the country&#039;s civil war</title>
   <link>https://www.dw.com/en/new-fighting-in-ethiopia-s-tigray-region-raises-fears-of-a-return-to-the-country-s-civil-war/a-79400869?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss</link>
   <description>Fighting in and around Tigray is testing Ethiopia&#039;s fragile 2022 peace deal. With old enemies forming new alliances, experts warn that the conflict could enter a dangerous new phase.</description>
